WEBVTT

00:00:00.332 --> 00:00:02.792
There's two days of water
left at the base.

00:00:02.832 --> 00:00:04.872
Only one, if we don't ration it.

00:00:06.374 --> 00:00:09.096
LETHE has blocked the river
with a force field.

00:00:09.136 --> 00:00:12.190
You have one job today:
get water and come back.

00:00:13.499 --> 00:00:14.984
The tank is empty.

00:00:15.024 --> 00:00:18.757
Dive several times:
each dive fills it by a third.

00:00:19.749 --> 00:00:22.421
A blue beam means a drone has spotted you.

00:00:22.461 --> 00:00:24.896
Red means turrets are firing at you.

00:00:24.936 --> 00:00:27.543
Every hit costs water through the holes.

00:00:30.332 --> 00:00:32.304
You can't break the boat from above.

00:00:32.345 --> 00:00:36.262
Dive under and hit it from below,
and take on water while you're there.

00:00:37.374 --> 00:00:40.288
Stay alert underwater
and steer around the mines.

00:00:40.328 --> 00:00:43.550
If the hydrojet overheats,
surface right away.

00:00:43.957 --> 00:00:46.805
Don't touch the force field,
it takes your water.

00:00:46.845 --> 00:00:51.163
Remember, skimming low over the river
slowly tops up the tank too.

00:00:51.874 --> 00:00:54.321
There are antennas on top of the last dam.

00:00:54.361 --> 00:00:59.484
Shoot them down, and a breach opens
in the force field, for just four seconds.

00:00:59.524 --> 00:01:01.140
I hope you make it through.

00:01:02.874 --> 00:01:05.634
Bring back at least
three quarters of a tank.

00:01:05.674 --> 00:01:07.631
Otherwise you'll have to fly again.
